  "description": "Jun-O was dumped by his girlfriend because he was bad in bed. In a fit of anger, he attends a class reunion and, while completely drunk, runs into his classmate Ha-Jin. Faced with Ha-Jin’s persistent questions about why he broke up with his girlfriend, he ends up confessing that he’s gay... Showing no sign of surprise at Jun-O’s confession, Ha-Jin even promises to send him an android so he can practice sex. But for some reason, Jun-O ends up getting “explored” all over by the android. Upon closer inspection, is it just a coincidence that the android looks like Ha-Jin?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
